.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
. 
.         * We consider the variable plh0004_clean a suitable measure for the p
> olitical
.         * leaning of a respondent. To estimate the effect if having a daughte
> rs leads 
.         * to more left-leaning political preferences, we conduct an instrumen
> tal 
.         * variable (IV) estimation using linear OLS regression. Specifically,
>  we 
.         * instrument the variable HasDaughter with first_daughter that indica
> tes 
.         * if the first born child is a daughter.
. 
.         ivreg2 plh0004_clean (has_daughter = first_daughter) $controls if par
> ental_age >= 10, robust first

